+### Deploy your own copy
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=Fechin%2Freference)
+
+Wasmer detects the Hexo site, runs `pnpm install` and `pnpm run build`, and serves the generated `public` folder as
+static files; the `_redirects` file keeps the `/golang` and `/css` redirects from `nginx.conf`. The button opens
+Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the detected build settings (and correct them if
+needed) before clicking Deploy; nothing is deployed until you do, and no copy of the repository is created in your
+GitHub account. To customize the cheat sheets, fork the repository and import your fork instead.
+
